    },
    "body": "The projection report left stale next actions and overstated completion of the specified search. This review retains the verified E/Q0/QG development results, identifies the omitted optimized s0 nearest seed and unmeasured Gram singularity, and scopes reload, attribution and resource evidence. Corrected E remains the numerical incumbent; the full prescribed QG search is unrun.\n\nSpecify one next DeepSeek implementation/experiment: query-conditioned older-state read versus equally parameterized separable history/query and local-only reads. The handoff binds exact inputs, artifact/scales, constructive and learned-query fixtures, gradients, optimizer/resume state, fixed fit dose, interventions, generated output, decision rules and a pre-use resource proposal. Synchronize the canonical dependencies and all current entry points. No Rust implementation, build, model forward or resource-balance change occurs in this documentation review.\n\nValidation: independently audited saved artifact sets/hashes and reaggregated dev means, paired intervals and permutation; independent mechanism review of the new equations/fixture/gradient; claim-wording script, relative links across all 11 changed documents, and git diff --check pass. CI compatibility acknowledgements are not model tests.\n\nReferences #973, #820, #963, #964. Broad programme acceptance remains open.\n",
